messages[11]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hi Pooja, this is Anita from Trust Wealth Advisors at DCoders. I'm calling about your health policy HP‑4521 – it's... [uh] nearing expiration.
  user_1,Oh hi Anita... yeah I saw the email. I... uh... haven't submitted the form yet.
  user_2,No worries, just wanted to see if you're still planning to renew. The deadline to return the signed renewal form is 12 Oct, end of day.
  user_1,If I don't get it in by tomorrow, will the policy just... expire?
  user_2,Yes, if we don't receive the form by the deadline, the policy will lapse and be marked as Expired. [sighs] That means no coverage from that date.
  user_1,Hmm... I think I might need a little more time. Is there any... grace period?
  user_2,Unfortunately, we can't extend beyond the date. Once it expires, you'd need to re‑apply as a new policy, which could affect rates. --
  user_1,Alright, I'll... send it today then. Can you confirm you have my email address?
  user_2,Sure, I have pooja.bhatia@example.com on file. I'll resend the renewal form right after this call.
  user_1,No, that's all. Thanks, Anita.
  user_2,Thanks, Pooja. Talk soon. Bye.